    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper struct for holding a set of builder options for LLVMRunPasses. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This structure is used to keep LLVMRunPasses backwards compatible with future versions in case we modify the options the new <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_pass" kindref="compound">Pass</ref> Manager utilizes. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
